WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You crossed the doorway. The reason for coming with you did not seem to follow.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Laboratory studies found that a change of room can make a recently held object harder to recall.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
That does not mean a door erases your memory. Your mind may be updating its current episode.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Try writing down one ordinary intention before a harmless room-to-room errand.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Compare what you remember and what may have distracted you. One trial proves nothing.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
If a short routine is what you need, try the free one first. Evaluate any paid audio separately.
